Z||000000||bHooper||09-15-2000||09:20 AM||||I'm going to the USGP (that's the Formula One race) at Indy next week... is anyone else planning on going?<P>This is going to be such a blast... I am already starting to hyperventilate  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Hope to see ya there!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT||||reg||10
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||09-15-2000||12:46 PM||||No, but I will be watching it live on tv ofcourse. Formula One is Europe's equivalent to Cart series racing, but with cars that are a *little* bit slower (225 mph) but are technically way more advanced than carts.<P>And ofcourse I will be cheering for Jos Verstappen, a dutch driver who took 4th place last week at Monza (where also unfortunately a track marshall died when he was hit by a wheel after a <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/monza2.asf" TARGET=_blank>major crash</A> of 6 cars).||||reg||1
Z||000002||HugGRRRFiero||09-15-2000||01:24 PM||||I'll be watching it live on TV.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">   I don't live too far to make it down to the Speedway.  I bet tickets sold out a long time ago.  I'll enjoy the views, replays, and updates of the whole race on TV, but just the experience of being there that day would be awesome.  <P>What part of the Speedway will you be at?  Well, have a great time, be sure to take pictures, scan and post if possible.<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">      <BR>      <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A>  <p>[This message has been edited by HugGRRRFiero (edited 09-15-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||bHooper||09-15-2000||02:06 PM||||i watched the replay of the Monza race, on speedvision, monday night... that was a <B>ugly</B> wreck.<P>we will be sitting in the infomous turn one... the most dangerous turn at any F1 event  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Cliff, i will be pulling for Jos to finish behind Schumacher... but well ahead of Hakkinan!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Looking forward to being a "Tifosy (sp)" for a weekend!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT||||reg||1
Z||000004||Cheever2||09-16-2000||12:06 PM||||I LOVE Formula-1!!!<BR>Cliff: The reason they seem slower than CART is they only do road courses, no high-speed ovals.  They have to get down to 20 for an unbelievable turn then go to near blackout G's in a few seconds up to 180 or more, then do it again about 5 seconds later.  IMO they can turn a street into a superspeedway.  Way more impressive to me than CART.  I do wish there were another American driver in F-1.<BR>  ||||reg||14
